{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowkeeper is a puzzle game about manipulating elements. By the light of fireflies, link and dissolve elemental forces to construct bridges, break through obstacles, and traverse a glowing, interconnected world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410660/extras/cd1e2c32f41a64bb70c9bdffb60f8379.poster.avif?t=1756434500\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410660/extras/cd1e2c32f41a64bb70c9bdffb60f8379.webm?t=1756434500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410660/extras/cd1e2c32f41a64bb70c9bdffb60f8379.mp4?t=1756434500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410660/extras/614771dd1642f038fc3e08f914791163.poster.avif?t=1756434500\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410660/extras/614771dd1642f038fc3e08f914791163.webm?t=1756434500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410660/extras/614771dd1642f038fc3e08f914791163.mp4?t=1756434500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 puzzles, built around an intuitive linking mechanic that\u2019s easy to grasp, yet builds upon itself to create layers and layers of challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open, interconnected world with multiple paths to explore. If you get stuck on a puzzle, there\u2019s always another route to take!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle difficulty curve with approachable puzzles for everyone, and plenty of optional challenges and secret tunnels for you to discover the history of this dim-lit world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully-designed hint system that nudges you toward a solution while still letting you experience the thrill of a eureka! moment on your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited undos and restarts \u2014 go at your own pace with no fear of making mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your firefly friend, learn the depths of this story set in a luminescent, ethereal landscape \u2014 unravel its secrets, mend what is broken, and change the fate of the world.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Open Your Map","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3410660/cfeadf0eb16ba21f6beacba68ce8744efab037de.jpg"},{"name":"Scroll Enjoyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3410660/2798a3af5966e6d37a32fd604271df2e7b0c4e00.jpg"},{"name":"Scroll Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3410660/e17c87b6565ab98bfbb51e17b608ae3c8001fe6c.jpg"},{"name":"Doomscroller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3410660/1b2261ec24356523674b7a9117e71dede9b307e4.jpg"},{"name":"Drowning in Scrolls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3410660/ec003fa3c41ae21e9fdb7321a50c62ee5f744f0c.jpg"},{"name":"Glow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3410660/2fb8216e8d128a139a66e96ef6b64c84f24feaa1.jpg"},{"name":"Glowkeeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3410660/2cd7ceda97dbe86588c35efbdadada8fa3503ad6.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3410660?t=1756434500",